<div class=\"slide\">\n    <div class=\"top-rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n    <h1 class=\"title\">Mentor Match turns matching into a lightweight workflow.</h1>\n    <p class=\"sub\">Capture what a mentee needs, surface aligned mentors, and support the first introduction with shared context.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"flow-wrap\">\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\">Simple product flow</div>\n\n      <div class=\"flow\">\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <div class=\"step-head\">\n            <div class=\"num\">1</div>\n            <div class=\"step-title\">Capture needs</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"icon\">\n            <svg width=\"34\" height=\"34\" viewBox=\"0 0 34 34\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <rect x=\"6\" y=\"5.5\" width=\"22\" height=\"24\" rx=\"5\" stroke=\"#4069C8\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n              <path d=\"M11 13H23\" stroke=\"#4069C8\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n              <path d=\"M11 18H23\" stroke=\"#4069C8\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n              <path d=\"M11 23H18\" stroke=\"#46B8C8\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">A short intake gathers what the mentee is trying to achieve, preferred guidance areas, and practical constraints.</div>\n          <div class=\"mini\">\n            <div class=\"mini-label\">Example inputs</div>\n            <div class=\"tag\" style=\"left:22px; top:54px;\">Career goal</div>\n            <div class=\"tag\" style=\"left:138px; top:54px;\">Skill focus</div>\n            <div class=\"tag\" style=\"left:256px; top:54px;\">Availability</div>\n\n            <div class=\"tag\" style=\"left:22px; top:103px;\">Industry interest</div>\n            <div class=\"tag\" style=\"left:167px; top:103px;\">Stage / role</div>\n            <div class=\"tag\" style=\"left:291px; top:103px;\">Communication style</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bottom-note\">\n            <div class=\"dot\"></div>\n            <div class=\"txt\">Reduces guesswork up front so mentors are considered against clear signals, not informal memory.</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <div class=\"step-head\">\n            <div class=\"num\">2</div>\n            <div class=\"step-title\">Surface aligned mentors</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"icon\">\n            <svg width=\"36\" height=\"36\" viewBox=\"0 0 36 36\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"14\" r=\"7\" stroke=\"#4069C8\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n              <path d=\"M19 19L29 29\" stroke=\"#4069C8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n              <path d=\"M14 10.5V17.5\" stroke=\"#46B8C8\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n              <path d=\"M10.5 14H17.5\" stroke=\"#46B8C8\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">The workflow highlights mentors whose experience, interests, and timing fit the request, making the shortlist intentional.</div>\n          <div class=\"mini\">\n            <div class=\"mini-label\">What the match view weighs</div>\n            <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 497 172\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" style=\"position:absolute; inset:0;\">\n              <rect x=\"22\" y=\"74\" width=\"453\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#EEF3FB\"/>\n              <rect x=\"22\" y=\"74\" width=\"367\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"url(#gradBar)\"/>\n              <rect x=\"22\" y=\"110\" width=\"453\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#EEF3FB\"/>\n              <rect x=\"22\" y=\"110\" width=\"322\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"url(#gradBar)\"/>\n              <rect x=\"22\" y=\"146\" width=\"453\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#EEF3FB\"/>\n              <rect x=\"22\" y=\"146\" width=\"279\" height=\"12\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"url(#gradBar)\"/>\n              <defs>\n                <linearGradient id=\"gradBar\" x1=\"22\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"389\" y2=\"80\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">\n                  <stop stop-color=\"#4F7CFF\"/>\n                  <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#46B8C8\"/>\n                </linearGradient>\n              </defs>\n              <text x=\"22\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#637492\">Relevant experience</text>\n              <text x=\"22\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#637492\">Shared goals / interests</text>\n              <text x=\"22\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#637492\">Practical fit and availability</text>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bottom-note\">\n            <div class=\"dot\"></div>\n            <div class=\"txt\">Makes selection faster while still keeping human judgment in the loop for the final pairing.</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <div class=\"step-head\">\n            <div class=\"num\">3</div>\n            <div class=\"step-title\">Support the introduction</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"icon\">\n            <svg width=\"36\" height=\"36\" viewBox=\"0 0 36 36\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <rect x=\"5\" y=\"8\" width=\"26\" height=\"20\" rx=\"5\" stroke=\"#4069C8\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n              <path d=\"M8.5 11.5L18 19L27.5 11.5\" stroke=\"#4069C8\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"27\" cy=\"25\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#46B8C8\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"desc\">A shared summary gives both sides enough context to start well, so the first outreach is informed and easier to act on.</div>\n          <div class=\"mini\">\n            <div class=\"mini-label\">Shared context packet</div>\n            <div class=\"tag\" style=\"left:22px; top:56px;\">Why they were matched</div>\n            <div class=\"tag\" style=\"left:222px; top:56px;\">Goals to discuss</div>\n            <div class=\"tag\" style=\"left:369px; top:56px;\">Suggested first step</div>\n\n            <div class=\"tag\" style=\"left:22px; top:105px;\">Short bio / background</div>\n            <div class=\"tag\" style=\"left:210px; top:105px;\">Availability notes</div>\n            <div class=\"tag\" style=\"left:360px; top:105px;\">Intro prompt</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bottom-note\">\n            <div class=\"dot\"></div>\n            <div class=\"txt\">Turns the handoff into a warm start instead of a blank introduction for either person.</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"arrow a1\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <svg width=\"30\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 30 30\" fill=\"none\">\n          <path d=\"M6 15H22\" stroke=\"#8EA4CC\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <path d=\"M16 9L22 15L16 21\" stroke=\"#8EA4CC\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"arrow a2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <svg width=\"30\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 30 30\" fill=\"none\">\n          <path d=\"M6 15H22\" stroke=\"#8EA4CC\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <path d=\"M16 9L22 15L16 21\" stroke=\"#8EA4CC\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"takeaway\">\n        <span>The product reduces friction for both sides and makes matching more intentional.</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
